      "content": "I hear you—that door feels impossibly thick, and the weight of wanting him is heavier than any effort to move forward. But you're not stuck because you're weak; you're stuck because you loved him deeply, and that love doesn't just vanish. For now, don't force yourself to take steps—just breathe, and let the ache be there without judging it. You don't have to reach him today; you just have to stay on this side a little longer, even if it's only for the next hour.",
